{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1490901-teleport-warp-difficulty","id":1490901,"title":"Teleport / Warp Difficulty","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-21T10:40:15-07:00","id":1490901,"title":"Teleport / Warp Difficulty","content":"What does everyone use as a metric to set difficulty for Aberrant powers such as teleport or warp?<br /> <br /> In the original game the distance traveled required a certain number of success. But it seems that you have to upgrade the power in this system to go farther.<br /> <br /> So it begs the question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27511-fanggrip","name":"FangGrip","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T10:57:03-07:00","id":1490905,"title":"","content":"It all depends on Scale, as far as I can determine. The greater a power\u2019s Scale, the more powerful it is. So, Warp <i>could</i> take you to the next city over...<i>or</i>, it can take you to the Andromeda Galaxy. It\u2019s all dependent on Scale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T11:14:58-07:00","id":1490906,"title":"","content":"There is no difficulty on Warp or Teleport, you just do it.<br /> <br /> You have a range, though, in the case of warp it is &quot;interplanetary&quot;, basically you open the gate and go wherever you can see or remember well enough, but Teleport too can be interplanetary, but requires a tag for that. The Storyguide may require some roll to remember a place you have not be for a long time, but other than that there is no assotiated roll or difficulty.<br /> <br /> More dots gives more tags and may be useful to resist someone trying to drain or supress your powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-22T19:18:57-07:00","id":1518598,"title":"","content":"The target location needs to be line of sight or \u201cwell known\u201d to the nova. That is a bit up in the air as to what counts as well known. Even more so if the nova in question has a perfect memory. I would probably say well known is a lived in space or one frequented by the nova to the point of knowing it like the back of their hand, when did I get a mole there?!! You could allow a nova to try and \u201cmemorize\u201d a location assigning a difficulty based on how long they spend and shave off difficulty or add enhancement for a perfect memory. Then it\u2019s also up to you if a photo or video would count and or if live video would even be easier. <br /> <br /> I created a tag that let the nova quantum tag a location. It was a one point tag can be taken multiple times and each time allows a new tag. They can sense it and shift to that location as if it was well known. With the understanding that it was a general location not a pinpoint, so they could not tag a person or object and then port to that location. I also did allow a one point tag that would let them summon a tagged item to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}